# Upstream pin for ferrometer. Plain key=value, no shell.
# URL + sha256 of the downloaded file; the same pair goes into the
# PKGBUILD's source=/sha256sums.
#
# GitHub's export of the release tag. The release attaches no source
# tarball, only the hand-rolled .deb/.pkg builds this recipe replaces. As
# with quictls: the content is fixed by the tag, the hash pins the bytes
# GitHub served, and a change in GitHub's archive compression would fail
# the hash check loudly.
ferrometer_url=https://github.com/rkivalin/ferrometer/archive/refs/tags/v0.5.0.tar.gz
